Turns a screen off without waiting on it, for niri's smithay: a panel's
power-down delay (about 200 ms on the XPS 14's eDP) ran inside niri's
commit, holding up its main thread at every lid shut and monitor
power-off. A commit refused as busy behind another on the same CRTC
waits as before.

--- a/src/backend/drm/surface/atomic.rs
+++ b/src/backend/drm/surface/atomic.rs
